# The pluck's sound set by number (the Editor's and the link's way, 0.17.78): from 42 up a sound's number and its place on the knob's list differ
# (the player's slots 42 .. 57 come after the thirty more in number, before them on the list). Set by number, it is that sound.
seed 0
wait 500
setpar 99 30
wait 100
expect par99 30
setpar 99 58
wait 100
expect par99 58
setpar 99 87
wait 100
expect par99 87
setpar 99 71
wait 100
expect par99 71
peakreset
wait 3000
expect peak_db_min -40
